      "refersTo": "input-field",
      "description": "Labelled pill field; sky border on focus, coral on error.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label class=\"ds-field-label\">Mobile number</label><input class=\"ds-field-input\" placeholder=\"24 123 4567\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;} .ds-field-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#6B7378;} .ds-field-input{height:54px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(91,124,143,.14);font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:#17191C;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s;} .ds-field-input::placeholder{color:#8E979D;} .ds-field-input:hover{border-color:#DDE4E9;} .ds-field-input:focus-visible,.ds-field-input:focus{border-color:#3AA6DB;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Featured Job Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-featured",
      "description": "The one sky-gradient card per group, with translucent Apply tab.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-feat\"><div class=\"ds-feat-top\"><div class=\"ds-co\"><span class=\"ds-logo\">K</span><div><div class=\"ds-co-name\">Kente Labs</div><div class=\"ds-co-sub\">Accra · <span class=\"ds-trust\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fff\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.6 8 11 4.6-1.4 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3zm-1.2 14.2-3.5-3.5 1.4-1.4 2.1 2.1 4.9-4.9 1.4 1.4-6.3 6.3z\"/></svg> Trusted</span></div></div></div><button class=\"ds-bm-glass\" aria-label=\"Save job\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fff\"><path d=\"M6 3h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v17l-7-4-7 4V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/></svg></button></div><div><div class=\"ds-feat-title\">Jr. UI/UX Designer</div><div class=\"ds-feat-pay\">GH₵ 4,500 – 6,000 <span>/ Month</span></div></div><div class=\"ds-feat-bottom\"><span class=\"ds-feat-count\">+12 applied</span><button class=\"ds-feat-apply\">Apply <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"/></svg></button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-feat{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;width:262px;height:200px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24px;padding:16px 0 0 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5FBDEA,#3399CF);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 22px rgba(63,167,218,.28);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .11s ease-out;} .ds-feat:active{transform:scale(.98);} .ds-feat-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;padding-right:16px;} .ds-co{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;} .ds-logo{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#2C88B4;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;} .ds-co-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;} .ds-co-sub{font-size:12px;opacity:.9;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;} .ds-trust{display:inline-flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;} .ds-bm-glass{width:34px;height:34px;border:none;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;} .ds-bm-glass:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-feat-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.3px;} .ds-feat-pay{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;opacity:.9;margin-top:4px;} .ds-feat-pay span{font-weight:400;} .ds-feat-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;} .ds-feat-count{font-size:12px;opacity:.9;} .ds-feat-apply{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;height:48px;padding:0 20px 0 30px;border:none;border-top-left-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;} .ds-feat-apply:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);} .ds-feat-apply:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:-3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Job Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "White 20px card with soft blue-grey shadow, active coral bookmark and pale Apply fade corner.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-top\"><div class=\"ds-co\"><span class=\"ds-logo2\">A</span><div><div class=\"ds-co-name2\">Asante Digital</div><div class=\"ds-co-sub2\">Kumasi · <span class=\"ds-trust\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#1FAE7A\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.6 8 11 4.6-1.4 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3zm-1.2 14.2-3.5-3.5 1.4-1.4 2.1 2.1 4.9-4.9 1.4 1.4-6.3 6.3z\"/></svg> Trusted</span></div></div></div><button class=\"ds-bm\" aria-label=\"Remove from saved\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#E5484D\"><path d=\"M6 3h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v17l-7-4-7 4V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-card-title\">Senior React Native Dev</div><div class=\"ds-card-pay\">GH₵ 9,000 <span>/ Month</span></div><button class=\"ds-apply-corner\">Apply <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"/></svg></button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;position:relative;width:340px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 16px 60px;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(127,166,189,.14);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .11s ease-out;} .ds-card:active{transform:scale(.985);} .ds-card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;} .ds-co{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;} .ds-logo2{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #EEF1F3;color:#D98A12;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;} .ds-co-name2{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#17191C;} .ds-co-sub2{font-size:12px;color:#6B7378;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;} .ds-trust{display:inline-flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;} .ds-bm{width:34px;height:34px;border:none;border-radius:50%;background:#FCEBEC;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .11s;} .ds-bm:active{transform:scale(.88);} .ds-bm:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #E5484D;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-card-title{margin-top:14px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.2px;color:#17191C;} .ds-card-pay{margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#17191C;} .ds-card-pay span{font-weight:400;color:#6B7378;} .ds-apply-corner{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:52%;height:44px;border:none;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;padding-right:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(214,238,248,0),rgba(206,234,247,1));color:#2479A6;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;} .ds-apply-corner:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(214,238,248,0),rgba(190,226,244,1));} .ds-apply-corner:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3AA6DB;outline-offset:-3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "segmented",
      "description": "Pill track with a sliding white thumb.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"ds-seg-item ds-seg-on\" role=\"tab\">Freelancer</button><button class=\"ds-seg-item\" role=\"tab\">Client</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;display:flex;width:320px;height:48px;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:999px;background:#E9EEF2;} .ds-seg-item{flex:1;border:none;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#6B7378;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .3s,color .3s,box-shadow .3s;} .ds-seg-item:hover{color:#17191C;} .ds-seg-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3AA6DB;outline-offset:-2px;} .ds-seg-on{background:#fff;color:#17191C;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(91,124,143,.14);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Slide to Confirm",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "slide-to-confirm",
      "description": "CTA-gradient pill with a pale thumb and fading chevrons; tap also confirms.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-slide\"><button class=\"ds-slide-thumb\">Apply Now</button><span class=\"ds-slide-chev\"><svg style=\"opacity:.35;margin-left:-5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 6 15 12 9 18\"/></svg><svg style=\"opacity:.5;margin-left:-5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 6 15 12 9 18\"/></svg><svg style=\"opacity:.65;margin-left:-5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 6 15 12 9 18\"/></svg><svg style=\"opacity:.82;margin-left:-5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 6 15 12 9 18\"/></svg><svg style=\"opacity:1;margin-left:-5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 6 15 12 9 18\"/></svg></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-slide{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;position:relative;width:340px;height:58px;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3A9DCB,#2A82AE);box-shadow:0 12px 22px rgba(63,167,218,.28);display:flex;align-items:center;} .ds-slide-thumb{width:120px;height:50px;border:none;border-radius:999px;background:#F2F9FD;color:#17191C;font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;cursor:grab;transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);} .ds-slide-thumb:hover{transform:translateX(8px);} .ds-slide-thumb:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-slide-chev{position:absolute;right:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floating Bottom Nav",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "bottom-nav",
      "description": "Frosted 32px-top nav with haloed, rotated sky squircle centre action.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-tab ds-tab-on\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 3 3 10v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5v-6h6v6h5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V10l-9-7z\"/></svg><span>Home</span></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M9 4h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zm0 3h6V6H9v1z\"/></svg><span>Jobs</span></a><a class=\"ds-centre\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Find work\"><span class=\"ds-halo\"></span><span class=\"ds-sq\"><span class=\"ds-sq-icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 8V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3M16 4h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3M20 16v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3M8 20H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-3M4 12h16\"/></svg></span></span></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4 4h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H9l-5 4V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/></svg><span>Chats</span><b class=\"ds-dot\"></b></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c0-4.4 3.6-7 8-7s8 2.6 8 7z\"/></svg><span>Profile</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;position:relative;width:375px;height:84px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-around;border-radius:32px 32px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.95);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ECF6FC,#FAFCFE);box-shadow:0 -6px 20px rgba(127,166,189,.12);} .ds-tab{position:relative;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#8E979D;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;transition:transform .1s;} .ds-tab:hover{color:#6B7378;} .ds-tab:active{transform:scale(.88);} .ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3AA6DB;outline-offset:2px;border-radius:12px;} .ds-tab-on,.ds-tab-on:hover{color:#3B7493;font-weight:600;} .ds-dot{position:absolute;top:-1px;left:calc(50% + 6px);width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#E5484D;border:1.5px solid #fff;} .ds-centre{position:relative;width:84px;height:84px;margin-top:-34px;display:grid;place-items:center;} .ds-centre:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3AA6DB;border-radius:50%;} .ds-halo{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(150,210,240,.35);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);} .ds-sq{position:relative;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:18px;transform:rotate(45deg);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5FBDEA,#3399CF);box-shadow:0 8px 14px rgba(63,167,218,.38);display:grid;place-items:center;transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1);} .ds-centre:hover .ds-sq{transform:rotate(45deg) scale(1.04);} .ds-centre:active .ds-sq{transform:rotate(45deg) scale(.9);} .ds-sq-icon{transform:rotate(-45deg);display:grid;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Pills",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-pill",
      "description": "Five semantic tones as soft-fill pills.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pills\"><span class=\"ds-pill\" style=\"background:#E3F2FA;color:#2479A6\">Active</span><span class=\"ds-pill\" style=\"background:#E5F6EF;color:#1FAE7A\">Paid</span><span class=\"ds-pill\" style=\"background:#FDF3E1;color:#D98A12\">Pending</span><span class=\"ds-pill\" style=\"background:#FCEBEC;color:#E5484D\">Disputed</span><span class=\"ds-pill\" style=\"background:#E9EEF2;color:#6B7378\">Draft</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pills{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;} .ds-pill{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Roboto,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:26px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Clear Morning Sky",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"The Clear Morning Sky\"**\n\nDevPay lives in a pale, frosted sky. Every screen opens on a sky wash that fades into a misty canvas, and work floats on it as white cards lifted by soft blue-grey shadow. Blue is the only voice with volume: one featured job card per group, the primary CTA, the slider, and the haloed centre action wear the sky gradient; everything else is white, mist, and ink. Small, precise accents carry meaning: coral for what you saved or what is at risk, green for what is trusted or paid.\n\nThe density is that of a well-made consumer job finder: generous 20px margins, 24px between sections, compact 12-15px text, and a lot of air between rounded shapes. Interactive controls are pills; containers are softly rounded rectangles (20/24px); sheets and the nav round to 32px. Motion is physical and short: a press scales down (0.97 default) and springs back, with a selection haptic.\n\nLight mode is the reference. Dark mode derives from the same hues: a deep blue-black canvas, the sky blue brightened for contrast, and shadows replaced by a one-pixel border.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Sky wash backgrounds (sky tint at top fading to mist canvas over ~360px).",
      "White cards, 20px radius, soft blue-grey shadow; featured cards 24px radius on the sky gradient.",
      "Pills for every control: chips, buttons, fields, search, segmented, slide-to-confirm.",
      "Pale \"Apply ↗\" fade corner on white cards; translucent \"Apply ↗\" tab on the featured card.",
      "Coral bookmark, green shield \"Trusted\", monogram/tile company logos in white rings.",
      "Floating frosted bottom nav with a haloed, 45°-rotated sky squircle as the centre action.",
      "System font only, hierarchy carried by 500/600 weights and tight negative tracking."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Sky Gradient Rule",
        "body": "Gradients come only from the sky family (card, CTA, screen wash, apply fade). Coral, green, and amber are always flat tints, never gradients.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Featured Rule",
        "body": "In any group of peers, at most one item wears the sky gradient (the first Recommended card, the Pro plan). The rest are white.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Accent Rule",
        "body": "Coral means saved, unread, or destructive; green means trusted, online, or paid; amber means pending. None of them decorate.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two-Weight Rule",
        "body": "500 and 600 carry all hierarchy; 400 is reading text. 700 appears only inside monogram logos.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tight Tracking Rule",
        "body": "Tracking is zero or negative and tightens as size grows (-0.1px at 15px to -1px at 34px). Nothing in the system tracks positive.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shadow-in-Light, Border-in-Dark Rule",
        "body": "Light mode separates surfaces with blue-grey shadow; dark mode removes the shadow and draws a 1px night-border. Never both.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Blue Lift Rule",
        "body": "Only sky-gradient elements get the blue lifted shadow; white elements never glow blue.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do start every screen with the sky wash fading into the mist canvas.",
      "Do make every interactive control a full pill and every container a 20px (or 24px featured) rounded rectangle.",
      "Do give exactly one item per peer group the sky gradient and lifted blue shadow.",
      "Do show company identity as a monogram or tile mark in a white ring, followed by \"City · Trusted\" with the green shield icon when verified.",
      "Do set money in GH₵ with tabular numerals and negative tracking.",
      "Do swap shadows for a 1px night border in dark mode.",
      "Do pair every press with the scale-and-spring response and a selection haptic."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't introduce a second typeface or weights outside 400/500/600.",
      "Don't track text positively or set labels in tracked uppercase.",
      "Don't use coral, green, or amber as decoration or as gradients.",
      "Don't put black or neutral-grey shadows on light surfaces; shadows are blue-grey or sky-tinted.",
      "Don't use real-brand logos for companies.",
      "Don't use square-cornered buttons, chips, or inputs."
    ]
  }
}